        "TileImage": "$($repository 081577db-297c-45ca-bf0e-19975ac2ec9c).Image",
        "Description": "We have just got word that the Templars are trying to take over the hotel to find info &amp; clues on your whereabouts.\rSo once again you got to go back there and take them out before they pass on any information to their masters.\rWe have Intel on what outfits they are using to remain un-noticed.\rOnce you have completed the task we advise you take the maintance tunnel under the hotel just in case the river and roads are being surveilanced.\rGood luck Agent, and will talk again soon.",
